    <briefdescription>
<para>Templated tree data structure (a tree node), parameterized by the type of the value (VT) stored at each node and type for indices (IT) used to &apos;name&apos; the child nodes. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Both IT and VT should have value semantics. This tree abstraction provides interfaces to create, destroy trees, retrieve and set child nodes iterate children nodes </para>    </detaileddescription>
